# Castle OS — GUI mode extras (Wayland).
# labwc: tiny wlroots stacking compositor. Rationale in docs/DECISIONS.md.
# Official Arch repos ONLY.

labwc             # Wayland compositor
swaybg            # wallpaper (solid color, Phase 1)
foot              # Wayland-native terminal
foot-terminfo
wofi              # app launcher (Super+D)
seatd             # seat management for non-root Wayland sessions
polkit            # privilege prompts for GUI helpers
xorg-xwayland     # X11 compat for stubborn apps
ttf-dejavu        # fonts so the UI isn't tofu
